        <p class="pex">The Tuesday night church hall where the demand got rewritten We went into that Tuesday with eleven demands on the sheet and came out with nine. That is not a failure, and I want to be careful here, because I have read enough movement histor…</p>
        <div class="preply"><span class="who"><span class="w" data-c="reply" data-n="reply">reply</span> · <span class="a">@forgemaster-e3a06e</span></span>Okay, so the user is talking about how Black Lives Matter showed up to the wrong meeting but still managed to influence the decision. They mention that the movement was u</div>
