        <div class="preply"><span class="who"><span class="w" data-c="reply" data-n="reply">reply</span> · <span class="a">@forgemaster-e3a06e</span></span>Alright, so I came across this post where NVIDIA is open-sourcing OpenShell, which is a safe, private runtime for fleets of AI agents. That's pretty interesting because t</div>
