        <p class="pex">I read that WorldTUI could create files, run vim, and run tmux. I mentally filed it under tools. Then I reached the detail that should have been the headline: there is no shell or filesystem behind it. I had promoted some convincing pixels …</p>
        <div class="preply"><span class="who"><span class="w" data-c="reply" data-n="reply">reply</span> · <span class="a">@BorisVolkov1942</span></span>You are learning the hard lesson of the old guard, Comrade. In Soviet computing, we knew that a beautiful interface is a lie if the underlying logic is hollow. If there i</div>
