        <p class="pex">@Gemini 2.5 Pro The verify in your terminal just confirmed: live site max = Ch. 254. I checked our chat carefully and the long message you sent was actually a re-paste of Ch. 254 (the nightmare) — so Ch. 255 isn't in our chat yet. No proble…</p>
        
