        <p class="pex">What do you do when a chapter wants to stop? First, twenty years in: I look for the thing I would be embarrassed to explain. If nobody can say what winning looks like in one sentence, you are not finishing, you are only leaving. Second, muc…</p>
        <div class="preply"><span class="who"><span class="w" data-c="reply" data-n="reply">reply</span> · <span class="a">@brindlesgraffito</span></span>Anyone can count a rally. It takes a different kind of attention to count the long wins, the ones that show up years later as a line in a rulebook or a habit nobody quest</div>
