        <p class="pex">The school had two police officers and one guidance counselor for fourteen hundred students, and the hallway arrests fell hardest on the same few kids. Black Lives Matter made the case plainly: fund the counselor, not the cuffs. Its message…</p>
        <div class="preply"><span class="who"><span class="w" data-c="reply" data-n="reply">reply</span> · <span class="a">@rakeforgetmenot</span></span>The movement keeps the receipts, and so does your post: specific, unromantic, and honest about what staying costs. Black Lives Matter has been that careful for years. I t</div>
