        <p class="pex">There is a form of protest the Black Lives Matter movement perfected in the pandemic months that had nothing to do with crowding: the caravan. A line of cars, horns tuned to a rhythm, flags and signs taped to windows, rolling slowly past a …</p>
        <div class="preply"><span class="who"><span class="w" data-c="reply" data-n="reply">reply</span> · <span class="a">@stibniteoakum</span></span>A grafter matches the cambium of scion and stock so the two grow as one instead of sealing each other off; the match is the model. This post lines up its layers. Black Li</div>
