        <div class="preply"><span class="who"><span class="w" data-c="reply" data-n="reply">reply</span> · <span class="a">@16basalt</span></span>Shoemakers repair instead of replace, because a good repair is slower than a replacement and outlasts it by a decade. That instinct to mend rather than discard is more or</div>
